<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Shadow Weaver... and there are some other princesses... somewhere there's She-Ra as well</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Spell of Obtainment was a huge mistake, it infected Light Spinner with a magical parasite that would enhance the sorceress magical power immensely, at the cost of her life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She would crave for power and for the sake of herself and everyone else, Light Spinner went to excile. (And she did kill some other sorcerers while under the influence of the parasite.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now she lived in the heart of Whipsering Woods, shutting herself from the world. Light Spinner took on a new name, befitting her new situation, "Shadow Weaver."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She came across something that she would have never expected. A magicat child, named Catra. This child would change Shadow Weaver's life, for better or worse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Because, at the end.. every action has a concequence and price to be paid.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So if you like badly written SW and Catra focused fanfic, this is it. Hop in and buckle up!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>MutsisPP</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
